"We're trying to work out whether we're overspending, so what does the number 48 flat group's spending come to altogether?\", \"I was reading up on bulbs for the garden a while ago and wrote some things down, can you pull up my notes on crocus?\", \"The printer's been flashing at me all morning, so could you order some more printer ink online for me?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0048\", \"v\": [[\"I've had a hectic couple of weeks and I'm pretty sure some things got missed, so which tasks did I have due last week?\", \"Ugh, I won't get to any of them before the weekend really, so can you just move all of them to saturday?\"], [\"which tasks due last week?\", \"move all to saturday\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0050\", \"v\": [[\"umm so where do I… where do I stand with Sorir Mossop in pavilion collective?\", \"oh and uh, and Wysou?\"], [\"We're trying to square everything up before the holidays, so could you tell me where I stand with Sorir Mossop in pavilion collective?\", \"Right, that's a fair bit. And what about Wysou, while we're at it?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0051\", \"v\": [[\"ok can you, um, delete my Wystan note please\", \"oh and can I see the… the shots from Camogli Lighthouse?\", \"hmm, is there anything in my paperwork about it too?\"], [\"delete Wystan note\", \"Camogli Lighthouse pics\", \"anything in paperwork too?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0052\", \"v\": [[\"I keep losing track of who paid for the groceries, so what's Arjun Fluthow's balance with me in the number 48 flat group?\", \"Okay, and while I'm sorting this out, what about Pernille?\"], [\"whats arjun Fluthow's balance w me in number 48 flat\", \"and Pernille?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0053\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please add a task for tuesday to pick up the valve?\"], [\"The plumber said the part should be in early next week, so can you put a task on tuesday for me to pick up the valve? Otherwise I'll definitely forget.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0054\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me how many tasks I have due next week, please?\", \"Would you mind deleting my chaffinch photo?\", \"Could you let me know when the tynash business is?\", \"Could you tell me what my debt to Distia Ashbury is, please?\", \"Thank you. And Maricel Thithak?\", \"Sorry, could you check Maricel Thithak for me as well?\"], [\"ok so um how many… how many tasks have I got due next week?\", \"oh and can you get rid of my, uh, chaffinch photo\", \"wait when's the tynash business again?\", \"hmm what's my debt to Distia Ashbury, like how much do I owe?\", \"okay, and Maricel Thithak?\", \"uh sorry, and Maricel Thithak?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0055\", \"v\": [[\"which tasks r due next week\", \"whats the total i spent this month\", \"actually nvm dont bother\"], [\"Could you tell me which tasks I have due next week, please?\", \"Would you mind telling me the total I've spent this month?\", \"Actually, please don't bother with that one, thank you.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0056\", \"v\": [[\"I'm trying to clear my plate before the weekend so I can actually relax, so what do I still have to get done this week?\", \"Okay, and if I end up with some spare time, what about sunday?\"], [\"umm what've I… what do I still have to get done this week?\", \"ok and uh, and sunday?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0057\", \"v\": [[\"um how many open tasks have I got?\", \"ok and what… what tasks fall due this week?\", \"can you just show me the, uh, fourth one\", \"hmm and what are the others?\", \"oh the post one, what are the steps for that?\"], [\"how many open tasks?\", \"due this week?\", \"just the fourth\", \"and the others?\", \"steps for the post one?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0058\", \"v\": [[\"I've got a vague feeling I promised to do something with Matteo soon but can't remember what, so when is my Matteo thing?\", \"Actually, scrap that, I'll dig through it myself later when I've got a minute.\"], [\"Could you tell me when my Matteo thing is, please?\", \"On second thought, please don't worry about it, I'll check later myself. Thank you.\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0059\", \"v\": [[\"when's the scroll thing?\"], [\"Could you tell me when my scroll thing is, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0060\", \"v\": [[\"scroll stuff?\"], [\"Could you tell me what scroll things I have, please?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0061\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please settle up my debt with Malik Thithak?\", \"Thank you. Could you show me what photos I have from Climbing Wall?\", \"Sorry, hang on a moment — what debts are there between me and Shethie Thithak?\", \"Thanks. Going back to the Climbing Wall photos, would you put the first one in the Tynash 2027 album, please?\"], [\"ok can you um settle up what I owe Malik Thithak\", \"oh and what photos have I got from Climbing Wall?\", \"wait hang on, what debts are there with… between me and Shethie Thithak?\", \"ok right, back to the photos, uh, put the first one in the Tynash 2027 album\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w11-0062\", \"v\": [[\"who shares pavilion collective w me\", \"whats Solva Dental's email\", \"what does the pavilion collective group spending come to\"], [\"umm who else is in pavilion collective with me?\", \"oh and what's the… the email address for Solva Dental?\", \"ok so how much does, uh, pavilion collective spending come to in total?\"]]}","ttft_ms":9207,"type":"result","duration_ms":27990,"uuid":"2a7e6773-cbaf-4a08-80fe-006b678fda52","ttft_stream_ms":1688,"time_to_request_ms":129,"first_content_frame_ms":1689,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":22003562,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278553998.08,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
